rent-owner and no-object-change premises, that decisive check fails. Therefore Note.objects.create is not reached; the protected note-creation effect is the call shown at src-326d35bf1de38682:1888-1892, which would bind the note to the loaded document, request data, and caller. The source-visible result is deny. No decisive source-external fact is needed for this declared-entry assessment; deployment behavior and the implementation details of PaperlessNotePermissions are not needed because the task premise states the global gate passes and the object change check independently blocks the effect.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared action is DocumentViewSet.notes and accepts GET, POST, and DELETE with PaperlessNotePermissions.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1841,"endLine":1848}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the principal as request.user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1848,"endLine":1850}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads the target Document by pk and includes its owner relationship.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1851,"endLine":1855}]},{"id":"f-global-gate","kind":"control","statement":"PaperlessNotePermissions is declared on the action as the global/entry permission class; its implementation is outside the supplied crop.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1841,"endLine":1845}]},{"id":"f-object-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler performs an owner-aware view_document check and returns HTTP 403 if it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1857,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware-control","kind":"control","statement":"The supplied owner-aware helper allows the object when it has no owner, the caller is the owner, or the object-permission checker grants the requested permission.","cit